WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.773
Unit seventeen. Road Safety and Helmets!

2
00:00:04.726 --> 00:00:08.152
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.202 --> 00:00:11.405
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.455 --> 00:00:15.298
Today we learn about Road Safety and Helmets. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.422 --> 00:00:19.506
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

6
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.386
Head injury. Say it with me. Head injury!

7
00:00:29.855 --> 00:00:32.905
Speed. Say it with me. Speed!

8
00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:40.222
Seatbelt. Say it with me. Seatbelt!

9
00:00:43.658 --> 00:00:47.059
Visibility. Say it with me. Visibility!

10
00:00:50.556 --> 00:00:53.523
Crash. Say it with me. Crash!

11
00:00:57.074 --> 00:01:00.007
Law. Say it with me. Law!

12
00:01:03.484 --> 00:01:07.401
Responsibility. Say it with me. Responsibility!

13
00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:21.198
A properly fastened helmet reduces the risk of serious head injury in a crash. Speed, no seatbelt, and poor visibility increase danger. Road safety is everyone's responsibility.

14
00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:24.126
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:30.570
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:31.770
Speed!

17
00:01:32.703 --> 00:01:37.739
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.789 --> 00:01:38.883
Law!

19
00:01:39.613 --> 00:01:47.104
Did you know? Road traffic injuries are the leading cause of death for people aged 5–29 worldwide, according to the WHO!

20
00:01:47.154 --> 00:01:48.917
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.612 --> 00:01:56.511
Think and answer. What makes a helmet effective?

22
00:01:56.561 --> 00:01:57.711
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.776 --> 00:02:03.515
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.565 --> 00:02:06.158
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

